  "row_as_dvr_section_argument": "Each source point x_j \u2208 F_89^5 lifts to a Teichm\u00fcller/integral point x\u0303_j \u2208 O^5 (finite field residue). By P25Y.1 the monic basis p_1,..,p_43 is an O-basis of V_25. Hence p_c(x\u0303_j) is O-integral for c in O^{43}, and F(p_c(x\u0303_j)) is a section of the integral landing ideal I_25 \u2282 O[c]_3. Its reduction mod \ud835\udd2d is exactly the cubic form F(p_c(x_j)) whose coefficient row is stored. Therefore every direct row is the reduction of a genuine section of the fixed DVR landing ideal.",
